  "ownership_rules": [
    {
      "name": "CPU-Map",
      "text": "fill_rect borgt nur die CPU-Adresse waehrend des Aufrufs. Der Caller haelt eine exklusive CPU-Schreibmap des gemeinsamen R4DRAW-BO-Vertrags und fuehrt danach unmap aus. Keine verborgene Kopie, GPU-Adresse oder VRAM-Lesung."
    },
    {
      "name": "Layout",
      "text": "Lineares RAM-Bild. Andere Modifier, GPU-Seitentabellen, Speicherallokation und Scanout bleiben bei ihren Besitzern."
    },
    {
      "name": "RENDER_V1 maps",
      "text": "R4GfxCpuImage addresses are caller-owned readable/writable CPU maps, never physical or GPU addresses. The caller holds exclusive target access, read access to sources, and immutable metadata until return. Different virtual mappings of the same backing must not be presented as independent images."
    },
    {
      "name": "RENDER_V1 execution",
      "text": "Commands execute in order with an explicit total-pixel budget. Whole rectangles must already be clipped by the caller. Images and output may not alias metadata. Complete validation precedes every write; no hidden frame copy, allocation, thread or graphics service."
    },
    {
      "name": "RENDER_V1 colors",
      "text": "Source-over uses premultiplied ARGB8888 and integer rounding; XRGB is opaque with zero stored padding byte. Blit converts XRGB/ARGB and scales with pixel-center nearest or bilinear filtering clamped to the source rectangle. R8 supports fill/blit, not source-over. Color space conversion remains a separate stage."
    }
  ]
}
